  "job_B3.4.40_20251003_114742": {
    "text": "Larspell.\nWe secgea\u00f0 urum cynehlaforde and eallum folce cy\u00f0an wylla\u00f0: \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle to gode\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t godes circan beon beteran m\u00e6\u00f0e and munde wyr\u00f0e, \u00feonne hig \u00e6r \u00feysan w\u00e6ron: \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd cristenum cyninge gebyra\u00f0 on cristenre \u00feeode, \u00fe\u00e6t he sy, eallswa riht is, folces frofer and rihtwis\nAnd him gebyre\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he eallum m\u00e6gene cristendom r\u00e6re and godes cyrcean \u00e6ghwar fyr\u00f0rie and\nAnd him gebyra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he geornlice fylste \u00feam, \u00fee riht willan, and a hetelice styre \u00feam, \u00fee \u00fewyres\nHe sceal mand\u00e6de men \u00fereagean \u00feearle mid woroldlicre steore, and he sceal mor\u00f0wyrhtan,\nAnd \u00e6g\u00f0er he sceal beon mid rihte ge milde ge re\u00f0e, milde \u00feam godum and styrne \u00feam yfelum.\nLa, \u00feurh hw\u00e6t sceal godes \u00feeowum and godes \u00feearfum fri\u00f0 and fultum cuman, butan \u00feurh Crist and\n\u00dei he sceal boclarum hlystan swy\u00f0e georne and godes beboda geornlice healdan and gelome wi\u00f0 wytan\n\u00c6lc riht cynestol stent on \u00ferym stapelum, \u00fee fullice ariht stent: an is oratores, and o\u00f0er is laboratores,\noratores syndon gebedmen, \u00fee gode sceolon \u00feeowian d\u00e6ges and nihtes for \u00fe\u00e6ne cyngc and for ealne\nlaboratores syndon weorcmen, \u00fee tilian sceolon \u00fe\u00e6s, \u00fee eall \u00feeodscipe big sceal lybban.\nbellatores syndon wigmen, \u00fee eard sculon werian wiglice mid w\u00e6pnon.\nOn \u00feysum \u00ferym stapelum sceal \u00e6lc cynestol standan mid rihte; and, awacyge heora \u00e6nig, sona se stol\nAc stalige man and strangie and trymme hi georne mid wislicre godes lage and mid rihtlicre\nAnd so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t we secga\u00f0, awacyge se cristendom, sona scylf\u00f0 se cynedom.\nAnd we cy\u00f0a\u00f0 eac eorlan and heretogan, deman and gerefan, \u00fe\u00e6t hig agan \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t hi georne\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t hig gehadedum mannum fylstan bet to godes lagum, \u00feonne hig \u00e6r \u00feysum dydon.\nHit w\u00e6s nu lange, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ron to wide godes laga la\u00f0e and lara forsawne, and woroldlaga syndan innan\nBetan \u00fea nu georne, \u00fea \u00fee \u00feyssere \u00feeode nu sceolan r\u00e6dan, swa swa god wyle, gif hig gode willan\nAnd we eac \u00fe\u00e6s habba\u00f0 fela byrsta and bysmora gebiden, and gif we \u00e6nige bote gebidan sceolan,\nFor\u00feam \u00e6r \u00feysan w\u00e6s gehwar swicdom swy\u00f0ra, \u00feonne wisdom, and \u00feuhte hwilum wisast, se \u00fee w\u00e6s\nAc wa heom \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6rscipes and ealles \u00fe\u00e6s weor\u00f0scipes.\nNe dohte hit \u00e6r \u00feysan inne ne ute, ac w\u00e6s here and hunger, bryne and blodgyte on gewelhwylcan ende\nFor\u00feam on \u00feison earde w\u00e6s and git is, swa hit \u00feincan m\u00e6g, unrihta fela and tealte getryw\u00f0a \u00e6ghwar\nFela syn forsworene and swy\u00f0e forlogone and wedd eac abrocene oft and gelome; and \u00fe\u00e6t is gesyne on\nAc uton don, swa us \u00feearf is, beon ymbe \u00fea bote, geswican unrihtes and gebugan to rihte; \u00feonne\nAnd riht is eac, \u00fe\u00e6t godes \u00feeowas, biscopas and abbodas, munecas and mynecena, preostas and\nAc gebuge manna gehwylc georne to rihte and muneca gehwylc into his mynstre o\u00f0\u00f0e of earde mid\nAnd riht is, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nige w\u00e6pnmen on mynecena beodderne ne etan ne ne drincan ne l\u00e6wede men on\nAnd preostas and nunnan heora lif rihtan be godes miltse and be heora are.\nAnd ealle godes \u00feeowas we bidda\u00f0 and l\u00e6ra\u00f0 and huru \u00feinga m\u00e6ssepreostas, \u00fe\u00e6t hig gode hyran and\nFull georne hig witan, \u00fe\u00e6t hig nagon mid rihte \u00feurh h\u00e6med\u00feing wifes gemanan, ac hit is \u00fee wyrse, \u00fee\nNu \u00feinc\u00f0 heom \u00feis syllic to gehyranne, for\u00feam \u00fee hig habba\u00f0 heora yrm\u00f0e swa on gewunan gebroht,\nCrist sylf astealde \u00fea cl\u00e6nnysse and his halgan apostolas, \u00fee him her on life folgedan, \u00fee we godes\nHit gewear\u00f0 \u00e6fter Cristes \u00ferowunge and \u00e6fter his \u00e6riste of dea\u00f0e and his upstige to heofenan and\n\u00dea gewear\u00f0 hit, \u00fe\u00e6t Constantinus, se m\u00e6ra casere and se \u00e6\u00f0ela Sancte Elena sunu, \u00fe\u00e6re eadigan\n\u00dea gegaderode he swy\u00f0e mycelne syno\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre, \u00fee is Nicea genamod, for trymminge rihtes\nSe forma sino\u00f0 w\u00e6s, swa swa we s\u00e6don, on Nicea ccc and xviii bisceopa; and se o\u00f0er w\u00e6s sy\u00f0\u00f0an on\n\u00deas feower sino\u00f0as syndon to healdenne, swa swa \u00fea feower Cristes bec.\nAnd hig eac gesettan ealle \u00fea \u00feenunge, \u00fee we habba\u00f0 to godes \u00feeowdome: to m\u00e6ssan and to uhtsange\nSi\u00f0\u00f0an w\u00e6ron for oft o\u00f0re sino\u00f0as wisra bisceopa wide on worolde, ac \u00feas w\u00e6ron \u00fea fyrmestan, and\n\u00d0encan \u00fea nu, \u00fee to \u00feam \u00feriste syn, \u00fe\u00e6t hig god oferseo\u00f0 and swa m\u00e6niges haliges mannes dom, swa\nAc to fela is \u00fe\u00e6ra, \u00fee \u00e6r \u00feisan misdydan.\nAnd se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s geswican wille and cl\u00e6nnysse lufian, habbe he godes miltse and to woruldwur\u00f0scipe sy\nAnd riht is, gif hw\u00e6t f\u00e6rlices on \u00feeode becym\u00f0 beon hit herer\u00e6sas, beon hit f\u00e6rcwealmas, beon hit\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t ure hlaford l\u00e6te asmeagean be \u00e6ghwylcum ende Englalandes ealle \u00fea manfullan, \u00fee nella\u00f0\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 and bidda\u00f0 and on godes naman beoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig cristen man bynnan syx manna\nNe on gehalgodre nunnan ne on \u00e6l\u00e6tan \u00e6nig cristen man ne gewifige \u00e6fre ne na ma wifa \u00feonne an\nWa \u00feam, \u00fee woh drif\u00f0 ealles to lange, buton he geswice.\nAnd sy \u00e6lc wydewe, \u00fee hig sylfe mid rihte gehealde, on godes gri\u00f0e and on \u00fe\u00e6s cynges; and sytte \u00e6lc\nAnd eac we beoda\u00f0 on godes \u00e6lmihtiges naman and on ealra his halgena, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man swa dyrstig ne\nAnd gif hit hwa gedon h\u00e6bbe, beo he utlah wi\u00f0 god and amansumad fram eallum cristendome and wi\u00f0\nAnd se \u00fee eard wille rihtlice cl\u00e6nsian and unriht alecgan and rihtwisnysse lufian, \u00feonne mot he georne\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t man geornlice beo on \u00e6ghwylcum ende ymbe fry\u00f0es bote and ymbe feos bote: swa ymbe\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t gehwilc man his teo\u00f0unge rihtlice gel\u00e6ste be godes miltse and be \u00fe\u00e6s cynges and be ealles\nAnd romfeoh gel\u00e6ste man \u00e6ghwilce geare be Peteres m\u00e6ssan; and se, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t ne gel\u00e6ste, sylle\nAnd freolsa and f\u00e6stena healde man rihtlice; sunnand\u00e6ges freols fram s\u00e6terd\u00e6ges none o\u00f0\nAnd ymbrenf\u00e6stena healde man rihte, swa swa Sanctus Gregorius Angelcynne sylf hit gedihte.\nAnd ealle godes gerihta fyr\u00f0rige man georne, \u00e6lc riht ar\u00e6re and unriht afylle, \u00feonne wyr\u00f0 \u00feysse \u00feeode\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle gem\u00e6nelice, gehadede and l\u00e6wede, anr\u00e6de weor\u00f0an for gode and for worolde and\nAc uton ealle anr\u00e6dlice to gode bugan and hine lufian and wur\u00f0ian and urne cristendom rihtlice\nAnd utan ge\u00feencean, \u00fe\u00e6t hit is nyr \u00feisse worulde ende, \u00feonne hwa gelyfan wylle, and \u00fe\u00e6s deofles\nAc deofol dwela\u00f0 manna ge\u00feohtas, \u00fe\u00e6t hig to lyt \u00fe\u00e6rymbe \u00feencea\u00f0.\nAnd, gelyfe se, \u00fee wylle, we witan to so\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fe\u00e6rto georne geneal\u00e6c\u00f0, for\u00feam \u00feeos worold is\nHw\u00e6t, we magon geseon, hu l\u00e6ne and hu ly\u00f0re \u00feis lif is, hu sarlic and hu sorhful and hu geswincful\nHeo is \u00feeos woruld on ofstum and on stormum and on adlum and on ungewyderum, \u00fe\u00e6t nu ne beo\u00f0\nAnd, \u00feeah \u00fe\u00e6t gelimpe, \u00fe\u00e6t men sume hwile syn her on worolde, swa\u00feeah hig beo\u00f0 aa on geswince\n\u00d0y us is mycel \u00feearf, \u00fee to godes bydelum gesette syn, \u00fe\u00e6t we godes folc warnian gelome wi\u00f0 \u00feone\nLa hw\u00e6t, is se man on life, buton hine god \u00e6lmihtig gehealde, and he \u00e6r \u00fee bet gewarad sy, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nLa, hwylc wundor bi\u00f0, \u00feeh se mennisca deofol synfullum mote heardlice derian, \u00feonne god ge\u00feafa\u00f0,\nNis se man on life, \u00fee m\u00e6ge o\u00f0\u00f0e cunne swa yfel hit asecgan, swa hit sceal gewur\u00f0an on \u00feam\nOn godes naman we bidda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t cristenra manna gehwilc hine sylfne georne be\u00feence and warnige wi\u00f0",
